metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 153: King Boo's SLOT MACHINE (TelesaSlot): the three drums (srotRulet) in their frame (srot_waku). His BossTelesa scene carries one as its Slot child and places it under him; on its own it just spins when told (MoveStart / ForceStopSlot / TickSlot). The faces read 0 COIN, 1 ENEMY, 3 JACKPOT, 2 FRUIT every 45 degrees."

